  user_input {
    user_response: "========================================================\nASSETS I WILL PROVIDE\n========================================================\n\nI will upload the following assets:\n\n\342\200\242 Sansera Engineering Logo\n\342\200\242 Hero Background Video\n\342\200\242 Product Images\n\342\200\242 Manufacturing Images\n\342\200\242 Factory Images\n\342\200\242 Automotive Component Images\n\342\200\242 Aerospace Images\n\342\200\242 Additional Branding Assets\n\nUse ONLY the uploaded assets throughout the homepage.\n\nDo not use stock images, placeholder images, placeholder logos, or placeholder videos.\n\n========================================================\nHERO VIDEO\n========================================================\n\nUse my uploaded hero video as the full-screen background of the Hero section.\n\nThe video should:\n\342\200\242 Autoplay\n\342\200\242 Loop seamlessly\n\342\200\242 Be muted\n\342\200\242 Cover the full viewport\n\342\200\242 Include a subtle dark overlay (30\342\200\22340%) for text readability\n\342\200\242 Play smoothly without lag\n\342\200\242 Maintain high quality\n\nDo not replace or modify my uploaded video.\n\n========================================================\nLOGO\n========================================================\n\nUse my uploaded Sansera logo in the navigation bar.\n\nThe logo should:\n\342\200\242 Be crisp and high resolution\n\342\200\242 Maintain aspect ratio\n\342\200\242 Scale properly on desktop, tablet, and mobile\n\342\200\242 Transition smoothly when the navbar changes on scroll\n\n========================================================\nIMAGES\n========================================================\n\nI will upload multiple images.\n\nAnalyze each uploaded image and place it in the most suitable section of the homepage.\n\nFor example:\n\n\342\200\242 Factory images \342\206\222 About / Manufacturing / Innovation\n\342\200\242 Automotive images \342\206\222 Automotive section\n\342\200\242 Aerospace images \342\206\222 Aerospace section\n\342\200\242 Industrial machinery \342\206\222 Capabilities\n\342\200\242 Manufacturing processes \342\206\222 Storytelling sections\n\nUse cinematic layouts and premium image compositions.\n\n========================================================\nREFERENCE WEBSITE\n========================================================\n\nI will also provide the current Sansera homepage as a design reference.\n\nStudy the existing homepage carefully.\n\nUnderstand:\n\342\200\242 Information hierarchy\n\342\200\242 Content structure\n\342\200\242 Navigation\n\342\200\242 Brand identity\n\342\200\242 Sections\n\342\200\242 User flow\n\nDo NOT copy the design.\n\nInstead, redesign the homepage with a completely modern UI while preserving the company\'s branding and content.\n\nThe new homepage should feel like the next-generation evolution of the existing website.\n\n========================================================\nCREATIVE FREEDOM\n========================================================\n\nImprove the design wherever possible.\n\nFeel free to:\n\n\342\200\242 Improve spacing\n\342\200\242 Improve typography\n\342\200\242 Improve layouts\n\342\200\242 Improve animations\n\342\200\242 Improve visual hierarchy\n\342\200\242 Improve user experience\n\342\200\242 Improve storytelling\n\342\200\242 Improve section transitions\n\342\200\242 Improve responsiveness\n\342\200\242 Add premium scroll interactions\n\342\200\242 Add elegant micro animations\n\nThe final result should be significantly better than the existing homepage while remaining professional and suitable for a Fortune 500 engineering company.\n\n========================================================\nIMPORTANT\n========================================================\n\nFocus only on creating one exceptional homepage.\n\nEvery section should feel premium.\n\nEvery scroll interaction should feel smooth.\n\nThe homepage should immediately impress visitors within the first few seconds and demonstrate world-class UI/UX and frontend engineering."
