  user_input {
    user_response: "Apply the \"Elegant Dark\" design theme to the app.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nDesign name: Elegant Dark\nDesign HTML:                   <!doctype html>\\n                  <html style=\\\"height: 100%; margin: 0;\\\">\\n                    <head>\\n                      <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n                      <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n                      <script src=\\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4\\\"></script>\\n                      <link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" />\\n                      <style>\\n                        body { margin: 0; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }\\n                        /* Fallback classes in case Tailwind fails to load in sandbox */\\n                        .h-full { height: 100%; }\\n                        .w-full { width: 100%; }\\n                        .flex { display: flex; }\\n                        .flex-col { flex-direction: column; }\\n                        .flex-1 { flex: 1 1 0%; }\\n                      </style>\\n                    </head>\\n                    <body>\\n                      <div class=\\\"w-[1024px] h-[768px] bg-[#050505] text-white font-sans overflow-hidden flex flex-col relative\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"absolute inset-0 opacity-40 z-0\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#050505] via-transparent to-[#050505] z-10\\\"></div>\\n    <div class=\\\"w-full h-full bg-[url(\'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1581091226825-a6a2a5aee158?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=1024\')] bg-cover bg-center\\\"></div>\\n  </div>\\n\\n  <nav class=\\\"relative z-20 flex justify-between items-center px-12 py-8 bg-gradient-to-b from-black/60 to-transparent\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-4\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"w-10 h-10 bg-red-600 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xl italic tracking-tighter\\\">S</div>\\n      <span class=\\\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight uppercase\\\">Sansera<span class=\\\"text-red-600\\\">.</span></span>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"flex gap-10 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-gray-300\\\">\\n      <a href=\\\"#\\\" class=\\\"hover:text-white transition-colors\\\">Automotive</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"#\\\" class=\\\"hover:text-white transition-colors\\\">Aerospace</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"#\\\" class=\\\"hover:text-white transition-colors\\\">Capabilities</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"#\\\" class=\\\"hover:text-white transition-colors\\\">Innovation</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"#\\\" class=\\\"hover:text-white transition-colors\\\">Contact</a>\\n    </div>\\n  </nav>\\n\\n  <main class=\\\"relative z-10 flex-1 flex flex-col justify-center px-12 pb-12\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"max-w-3xl mb-12\\\">\\n      <h1 class=\\\"text-[84px] leading-[0.9] font-bold tracking-tighter uppercase mb-6\\\">\\n        Engineering <br/><span class=\\\"text-transparent border-t border-b border-white/20 px-2 py-1\\\" style=\\\"-webkit-text-stroke: 1px white;\\\">Precision</span> Movement.\\n      </h1>\\n      <p class=\\\"text-xl text-gray-400 font-light leading-relaxed max-w-xl\\\">\\n        Global leaders in high-integrity components for the automotive, aerospace, and specialized industrial sectors.\\n      </p>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <div class=\\\"grid grid-cols-4 gap-4 h-[320px]\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"group relative overflow-hidden bg-zinc-900 border border-white/10\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"absolute inset-0 bg-[url(\'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1597655684711-2e9218204680?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=300\')] bg-cover opacity-60 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-700\\\"></div>\\n        <div class=\\\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black via-black/20 to-transparent\\\"></div>\\n        <div class=\\\"absolute bottom-6 left-6\\\">\\n          <p class=\\\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-red-500 mb-1 font-bold\\\">Mobility</p>\\n          <h3 class=\\\"text-lg font-bold uppercase\\\">Automotive</h3>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"group relative overflow-hidden bg-zinc-900 border border-white/10\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"absolute inset-0 bg-[url(\'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1517976487492-5750f3195933?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=300\')] bg-cover opacity-60 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-700\\\"></div>\\n        <div class=\\\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black via-black/20 to-transparent\\\"></div>\\n        <div class=\\\"absolute bottom-6 left-6\\\">\\n          <p class=\\\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-red-500 mb-1 font-bold\\\">Future Tech</p>\\n          <h3 class=\\\"text-lg font-bold uppercase\\\">Aerospace</h3>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"group relative overflow-hidden bg-zinc-900 border border-white/10\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"absolute inset-0 bg-[url(\'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1504917595217-d4dc5ebe6122?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=300\')] bg-cover opacity-60 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-700\\\"></div>\\n        <div class=\\\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black via-black/20 to-transparent\\\"></div>\\n        <div class=\\\"absolute bottom-6 left-6\\\">\\n          <p class=\\\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-red-500 mb-1 font-bold\\\">Industrial</p>\\n          <h3 class=\\\"text-lg font-bold uppercase\\\">Agriculture</h3>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"bg-white flex flex-col justify-between p-8 text-black\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"space-y-4\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"border-b border-black/10 pb-4\\\">\\n            <p class=\\\"text-[32px] font-bold tracking-tighter\\\">15+</p>\\n            <p class=\\\"text-[10px] uppercase font-semibold tracking-widest\\\">World-class Facilities</p>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"pb-4\\\">\\n            <p class=\\\"text-[32px] font-bold tracking-tighter\\\">40Y</p>\\n            <p class=\\\"text-[10px] uppercase font-semibold tracking-widest\\\">Of Engineering Heritage</p>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n        <button class=\\\"w-full py-4 border border-black text-[11px] uppercase font-bold tracking-widest hover:bg-black hover:text-white transition-all\\\">Explore Solutions</button>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  </main>\\n\\n  <footer class=\\\"relative z-20 px-12 py-6 border-t border-white/5 flex justify-between items-center bg-black\\\">\\n    <p class=\\\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-gray-500\\\">\302\251 2024 Sansera Engineering Ltd. All rights reserved.</p>\\n    <div class=\\\"flex gap-8 text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-gray-400 font-medium\\\">\\n      <span>ISO 9001:2015</span>\\n      <span>IATF 16949</span>\\n      <span>AS 9100D</span>\\n    </div>\\n  </footer>\\n</div>\\n                    </body>\\n                  </html>\nDesign instructions: Extract ONLY the styling (colors, fonts, spacing, borders, shadows, backgrounds, gradients) and layout patterns (flexbox/grid structure, component arrangement) from the Design HTML above. Do NOT replace or restructure the existing app\'s HTML elements \342\200\224 preserve all existing components, content, and functionality. Only modify CSS/styling and adjust layout containers as needed to match the theme\'s aesthetic. You MUST execute file editing or creation tool calls (such as edit_file, multi_edit_file, or create_file) to apply styling updates to target files directly. Do NOT output code blocks, HTML, or TSX directly in your text chat response.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
    items {
