  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Asset Representation**\n\nI\'ve determined that `load_video` wasn\'t necessary. My focus has shifted to analyzing the images and assets the user provided. I\'m currently looking at the uploaded assets to figure out how best to represent them. I\'m starting with \"Sansera Engineering.\"\n\n\n**Exploring Visual Assets**\n\nI\'ve made progress on asset representation. Specifically, I\'m focusing on the Sansera logo, which I\'ve determined should be implemented as a high-resolution SVG, along with a dark-theme variant. Next, I\'m thinking how to represent the provided video frames. I\'m exploring the idea of a dynamic, interactive canvas or a video simulation of industrial robotics with a dark overlay and HUD telemetry. I\'m also considering the implications of the uploaded images.\n\n\n**Defining Asset Representation**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on defining how to represent these assets, using SVG or Canvas renders where possible. The images featuring components like crankshafts and robotics are my priority. I\'m aiming for high-resolution, interactive assets, and exploring embedded SVGs and data URLs for visual clarity. I\'m focusing on ensuring each section boasts a pristine, crystal-clear presentation.\n\n\n**Refining Visual Integration**\n\nI\'m now integrating those high-tech assets directly into a cohesive structure, informed by both the uploaded assets and the reference website details. The top bar is set; the Sansera logo will be SVG, paired with navigation and interactive elements. A fullscreen video with a particle grid, dark overlay, and a \"GLOBAL LEADER\" badge will complete the hero section. I\'m focusing on the clarity and high-tech feel.\n\n\n**Integrating Interactive Elements**\n\nI\'m now integrating interactive CTAs: \"Explore Our Solutions,\" which will trigger a smooth anchor scroll, and \"Contact Our Experts,\" which will activate an interactive RFQ/contact modal. A live telemetry ticker will run at the bottom of the hero section, featuring key metrics like facility counts and workforce size. I\'m focusing on \"Who We Are\" next, with the section title and \"Four Decades of Engineering Excellence\" as the content.\n\n\n**Showcasing Manufacturing Facility**\n\nI\'m now thinking about how to visualize the manufacturing plant and equipment with interactive elements. I want to highlight the high-bay manufacturing area, CNC lines, and precision engineering floor. I\'m imagining interactive hotspots displaying telemetry from various points: CMM Inspection, Automated Robotic Cell, and 5-Axis CNC Milling.\n\n\n\n**Defining Interactive Section**\n\nI am now focusing on the \'Our Strength\' section. I envision a three-pillar interactive layout to represent \"Integrated Engineering Expertise,\" \"Advanced Manufacturing,\" and \"Automation Leadership\". I plan on including interactive deep-dives with schematics and key metrics for each pillar. Next, I plan to create \"Capabilities\" with interactive cards featuring rich visuals, specs, and modal deep-dives. This section will include cards for Design & Engineering, Precision Forging, Precision Machining, Robotics & Automation, and Heat Treatment & Surface Finishing, complete with detailed specifications.\n\n\n**Visualizing Key Metrics**\n\nI\'m now integrating critical data and interactive elements. I plan on including a section on metrology and quality assurance, which will feature Zeiss CMMs, roundness testers, and eddy current crack detection capabilities. I am also planning on including the in-house machine-building advantages as an interactive tool that compares standard setups with custom in-house systems. I\'m also planning to create a section for ESG & Sustainability and a partner showcase.\n\n\n**Structuring Investor Relations**\n\nI\'m now structuring the Investor Relations section, focusing on live market data with NSE/BSE integration and historical performance. I\'ll include downloadable financial reports and corporate governance documents, all within interactive modules. I\'m also thinking about incorporating an interactive Engineering Configurator to match requirements with Sansera\'s capabilities. A strong call to action will complete the experience.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 11
      nanos: 713470285
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
