        }
        lines {
          text: "    description: \'Our in-house heat treatment infrastructure delivers precise metallurgical case depths, minimal thermal distortion, and optimized core toughness. Controlled atmosphere seal quench furnaces, continuous mesh belt furnaces, and high-frequency induction hardening lines run 24/7.\',"
