  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Website Components**\n\nI\'m currently focused on dissecting the essential components of a robust corporate website for Sansera Engineering. My immediate attention is on identifying all necessary sections, specifically starting with the Capabilities Section. I am currently considering its purpose, and the subsections to include such as Design & Engineering Simulation.\n\n\n**Expanding Capabilities Analysis**\n\nI\'m now expanding my examination of the Capabilities Section for Sansera. I\'ve broken it down into specific areas, including Forging, Machining, and Automation. I\'m imagining an interactive explorer showing equipment specs and output metrics, plus simulations. I\'m also considering highlighting their in-house machine-building prowess, with interactive comparisons and visualizations.\n\n\n**Mapping Global Facilities**\n\nMy focus has shifted to visualizing Sansera\'s global footprint. I\'m developing an interactive map component, detailing their 17+ plants across India and Europe, and considering integrating facility details, certifications, and workforce statistics. An interactive plant switcher seems crucial to navigating this information.\n\n\n**Integrating Financials and RFQ**\n\nI\'m now integrating financial data, like Q3 FY24 results, annual reports, and corporate governance info, alongside an interactive Engineering RFQ and CAD Spec Configurator modal. The RFQ wizard will allow clients to submit drawings, tolerances, and material grades for instant quotations.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 8
      nanos: 969713218
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
