  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Verifying Build Success**\n\nI\'m pleased to report the initial build was successful, a positive start! Now, I\'m diligently cross-referencing all project requirements. Currently, I\'m focusing on validating the aesthetic elements, like the chosen color palette (`#07090e`), typography (`Space Grotesk`, `Plus Jakarta Sans`), and the \"Elegant Dark\" design theme, with its high-tech industrial accents.\n\n\n**Detailing the Hero Section**\n\nI\'m now diving deep into the Hero Section. I\'m focusing on the immersive high-tech canvas simulation. I plan to incorporate robotic arms, CNC laser scanning, and spark discharges. I\'m also considering the best dark overlay percentage for text readability. Then, I am moving on to animations and the HUD telemetry. I\'ll need to figure out the best way to present the stock ticker and the 4-stat heritage banner.\n\n\n**Analyzing Capabilities & Data**\n\nI\'m now fully immersed in the core capabilities, focusing intently on presenting the key differentiators. I\'m prioritizing the visual data representation for ease of comprehension. Specifically, I\'m concentrating on the Engineering specifications, and metallurgy details. I plan to highlight the advanced metallurgy and heat treatment. I also want to spotlight the in-house machine building and robotics\' cycle time comparison in a real-time cell architecture.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I have completed the development of the **Sansera Engineering** next-generation corporate portal, applying the **Elegant Dark** design theme with high-precision industrial aesthetics and interactive engineering modules:\n\n- **Robotic Manufacturing Canvas & HUD**: Built a real-time procedural canvas showcasing 6-axis robotic kinematics, laser metrology scanning, and live plant telemetry (spindle speed, cycle times, tolerance grades, and view-angle controls) with a subtle dark overlay for optimal text contrast.\n- **Four Decades of Excellence**: Highlighted Sansera\'s 1981 Bengaluru founding, plant floor capabilities, and an interactive 4-decade milestone timeline (1981 Genesis to NSE/BSE listing and EV global leadership).\n- **Interactive 3D CAD Component Inspector**: Engineered a dynamic CAD canvas for inspecting precision crankshafts, fracture-split connecting rods, valvetrain rocker arms, and titanium aerospace actuators with **Exploded View**, **Wireframe CAD Mode**, and **360\302\260 Auto-Rotation**.\n- **Integrated Manufacturing Ecosystem**: Outlined core competencies across 4,000T closed-die forging, 2,500+ CNC machines, controlled-atmosphere heat treatment, and Zeiss sub-micron metrology cleanrooms.\n- **In-House Machine Building & Robotics**: Showcased Sansera\'s proprietary Special Purpose Machine (SPM) division with an interactive cycle-time comparator (40% CapEx and cycle time reduction vs. off-the-shelf tooling).\n- **Global Footprint & Interactive Facilities**: Mapped 17+ manufacturing plants across India (Bangalore, Harohalli SEZ, Bidadi, Pantnagar, Pune) and Europe (Trollh\303\244ttan, Sweden) with plant specs, workforce counts, and certifications.\n- **Tier-1 OEM Partnerships**: Categorized direct supply relationships with global automotive and aerospace leaders (Hero, Honda, JCB, KTM, Volkswagen, Yamaha, Maruti Suzuki, Aerospace Tier-1, Ducati, Stellantis).\n- **ESG, Sustainability & Investor Relations**: Highlighted 45.2 MWp solar generation, 100% Zero Liquid Discharge, steel circularity, audited Q4 FY24 financials (\342\202\2712,814 Cr annual revenue, 17.2% EBITDA), and a live NSE stock ticker.\n- **Engineering RFQ & Datasheet Modals**: Implemented a comprehensive technical RFQ submission wizard supporting CAD drawing uploads, tolerance selections, metallurgy grades, volume projections, and mutual NDA verification."
